# Repo policy: text files use LF in both repo and working tree.
#
# Why: deploy.js (in 4veco-platform) writes LF-terminated files into this
# repo. Windows core.autocrlf=true previously converted those to CRLF on
# checkout, producing a "modified" flag on every deploy even when content
# was unchanged. Pinning eol=lf removes the mismatch.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary types — disable line-ending normalization explicitly.
*.docx  binary
*.pptx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.zip   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
